Verdict: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**

The proof relies on an unsound recursive-call rule that substitutes the desired specification result instead of executing or proving the recursive body. Fresh control-state and body-mutation witnesses demonstrate false conclusions. The candidate also raises `RecursionError` on valid long inputs.

